y communicating, egocentric, not willing to further education. Emphasize B's strengths and that communication issues are manageable.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: something like \"I understand Agent 1's points, but I still recommend B because ...\". Then METADATA_JSON with agent \"agent_3\" and vote \"Candidate B\". Ensure format exactly.\n\nProceed."}
